<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (Modern Go provides typed atomic values \(Int64, Uint64, Bool, Pointer\) that are much safer and easier to use than the old low-level functions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
