<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (CompareAndSwap \(CAS\) is the fundamental building block of all lock-free algorithms. It is a single, atomic CPU instruction that updates a variable only if its current value matches what you expect.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
