141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (Handling Failure: If another goroutine changed the value between your Read and your Swap, the CAS operation returns false. In a lock-free system, you don't block; you simply loop back and try again.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
